{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:57:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_49741b2f13544dff8591645a5c8164b9","id":"pg_5b599dfbc9f45719b33d8886a48458ee","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/humanstack-vibe-coding-template-authsetup-md-7cec003ce14e-8886a48458ee.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_8c577f0284d45829a1ae77962afe0605"],"title":"humanstack/vibe-coding-template/AuthSetup.md @ 7cec003ce14e","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:57:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_49741b2f13544dff8591645a5c8164b9"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_25ae4abfc6c9793739a041f533e38bbe5dbea58ddd02c9a078d24bfaf67e6bbe"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The backend includes an abstracted LLM service supporting OpenAI and Claude, a vector embeddings service, and Qdrant integration with document storage and semantic search."},{"claim_ids":["clm_26899ffffbf601995b0801b92d4d3240569253ceb5d717a2c01bf2f188ace99e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The vector database layer falls back automatically to a local in-memory database when Qdrant is unavailable."},{"claim_ids":["clm_287aee8924c465f7f7b7f7bef87e62f69e59866dfebe153659e629292ecbfa43"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The frontend is a Next.js application using Tailwind CSS with a Supabase client and complete auth flows including login, signup, and password reset."},{"claim_ids":["clm_4947b76bfe1e4c6475b49cd09b21b62f6e86f1e6415a272e6eb1f47de2c79b14"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Prerequisites include Docker and Docker Compose, Make, Node.js 18+, Python 3.10+, and the Supabase CLI for migrations."},{"claim_ids":["clm_55039d88b7f6199ff53bd05094fc6da687beed15f61b036c7a0cfc91111a2a96"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The template ships a Python FastAPI backend with Supabase integration for auth, database, realtime, storage, and migrations, plus LLM and vector-database services."},{"claim_ids":["clm_882e0ef5c44847fbbfcf2ee55d63250d4cfa5668906cdf26953d0e697807fcb1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Environment configuration requires Supabase URL and service key, OpenAI and/or Anthropic API keys for LLM features, and optionally Qdrant credentials."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8a2202f3089e9aa0c7d5bd0c536377bdb4631a1a215bd56952a5dd52d13a8cc1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Running the dev environment exposes the frontend at localhost:3000, the backend API at localhost:8000, and API docs at localhost:8000/docs."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e214456fd9a250d4bc11bc5352c910f5687496e0ecce1393e8b65f4a81418228"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: setup is via ./first-time.sh (tool checks, API key prompts, .env generation) or manually by copying .env.example files, then make dev."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ea0dbbe6943764224bbd0c0a94e65958c9e38ac07ac843724a62cbae00bf8f7b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A Makefile provides commands such as make dev, prod variants, clean, and database migration commands like db-migration-new, db-apply, db-list, db-status, and db-push."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f6e674f5040deb64a79525f1a7570968541277baa9ab46141462f23aebf9951c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: the repo includes Cursor rules under .cursor/rules/ that apply automatically based on edited files, with templates like @api-endpoint-template and @react-component-template."}],"claim_ids":["clm_25ae4abfc6c9793739a041f533e38bbe5dbea58ddd02c9a078d24bfaf67e6bbe","clm_26899ffffbf601995b0801b92d4d3240569253ceb5d717a2c01bf2f188ace99e","clm_287aee8924c465f7f7b7f7bef87e62f69e59866dfebe153659e629292ecbfa43","clm_4947b76bfe1e4c6475b49cd09b21b62f6e86f1e6415a272e6eb1f47de2c79b14","clm_55039d88b7f6199ff53bd05094fc6da687beed15f61b036c7a0cfc91111a2a96","clm_882e0ef5c44847fbbfcf2ee55d63250d4cfa5668906cdf26953d0e697807fcb1","clm_8a2202f3089e9aa0c7d5bd0c536377bdb4631a1a215bd56952a5dd52d13a8cc1","clm_e214456fd9a250d4bc11bc5352c910f5687496e0ecce1393e8b65f4a81418228","clm_ea0dbbe6943764224bbd0c0a94e65958c9e38ac07ac843724a62cbae00bf8f7b","clm_f6e674f5040deb64a79525f1a7570968541277baa9ab46141462f23aebf9951c"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:57:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_49741b2f13544dff8591645a5c8164b9","id":"pg_8b68929361a15f4fb01e05e9a5c7c77b","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/humanstack-vibe-coding-template-readme-md-7cec003ce14e-05e9a5c7c77b.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_5bfb50cfdf6c5f2e8fe0ec5af803394c"],"title":"humanstack/vibe-coding-template/README.md @ 7cec003ce14e","updat